    {
      "title": "SOV Word Order",
      "explanation": "Like Japanese, Korean follows Subject-Object-Verb order. The verb always comes last.",
      "examples": ["저는 사과를 먹어요. (I apple eat = I eat an apple.)", "선생님은 책을 읽어요. (Teacher book reads = The teacher reads a book.)"]
